  "body": "As an alternative to the read loop, you can do e.g.\n\n``` js\nreadableStream.pipeTo(new WritableStream({\n    write(chunk) {\n      console.log(value);\n    },\n    close() {\n      console.log(\"--- all done\");\n    }\n    abort(e) {\n      console.log(\"--- error in the readable stream\", e);\n    }\n  });\n```\n",
